{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09598","headline":"虢州郡斋南池幽兴因与阎二侍御道别 · 岑参","name":"虢州郡斋南池幽兴因与阎二侍御道别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池色净天碧，水凉雨凄凄。\n快风从东南，荷叶翻向西。\n性本爱鱼鸟，未能返岩谿。\n中岁徇微官，遂令心赏睽。\n及兹佐山郡，不异寻幽栖。\n小吏趋竹径，讼庭侵药畦。\n胡尘暗河洛，二陕震鼓鼙。\n故人佐戎轩，逸翮凌云霓。\n行军在函谷，两度闻莺啼。\n相看红旗下，饮酒白日低。\n闻君欲朝天，驷马临道嘶。\n仰望浮与沈，忽如云与泥。\n夜眠驿楼月，晓发关城鸡。\n惆怅西郊暮，乡书对君题。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}